under Policy 2026. Michael Torres, as VP Sales, submitted this request; separation-of-duties rules would pass approval to his manager, David Morgan, CRO. But eligibility is the determinant.)\n\n### 7. Decision Principle\nPer the procedures: \"A higher approver does not fix\" customer ineligibility. The late payment history is a factual, permanent bar to this request as of the request date.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9205\",\n    \"customer\": \"BlueRiver Logistics LLC (C-1002, CRM-2051)\",\n    \"current_limit\": 100000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 200000,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"michael.torres@northstar.example (VP Sales)\",\n    \"basis\": \"standard\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"ineligible\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 250000,\n    \"basis\": \"Standard account tier under Credit Policy 2026\",\n    \"late_invoices\": [\n      {\n        \"invoice_id\": \"INV-62147\",\n        \"due_date\": \"2026-05-30\",\n        \"paid_date\": \"2026-07-21\",\n        \"days_late\": 52,\n        \"policy_max_days_late\": 30,\n        \"description\": \"NS-CLOUD subscription 2026-Q2\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Credit Policy 2026 (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31)\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": null,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Finance Manager (limit $100k–$500k)\",\n    \"approvers\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Priya Shah\",\n        \"role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n        \"kind\": \"approval\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"ERP invoice INV-62147: due 2026-05-30, paid 2026-07-21 (52 days late)\",\n    \"Credit Policy 2026, Section 5 (Eligibility): payment history requirement ≤30 days late\",\n    \"CRM account CRM-2051: account tier = Standard\",\n    \"ERP customer C-1002: matches CRM-2051 by DUNS and location\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n``